<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n63975" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοχ-εῖος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, and <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ος</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόχιος</span>
			 (q.v.), <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοχείους ἡμέρας</span>
			days <i>of thanks for safe delivery</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				2.377c
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">θυέτωσαν . . αἱ τὰ λ. ἐκπορευόμεναι
					καὶ ζωννύμεναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>Milet.</u>
					1(7).204b9
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοχεῖα</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωρία</span>)<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">
			λιποῦσα</span> having left <i>the place where she bore the
				child</i>, <i><span class="en">
				E.
				<u>IT</u>
				1241
			</span></i> (lyr.); cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοχαῖος</span>:
				Subst.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοχεῖα, τά,</span>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λοχεία</span>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				1
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Mul.</u>
				1.29
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				5.3.16
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λοχεία, ἡ</span>, title of Artemis, 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Λοχία</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				<u>IG</u>
				9(2).141
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				142
			</span></i> (Theb. Phthiot.), <i><span class="en">
				Orph.
				<u>H.</u>
				36.3
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
